---
import Skelet from "../layouts/Skelet.astro";
import Gradient from "../components/Gradient.astro";
import CardCategory from "../components/Card_Category.astro";
import "../style/styles.css";
---

<Skelet>
  <main>
    <section>
      <Gradient />
      <div class="image_section"></div>
    </section>
    <div class="headline_section">
      <div class="categories">
        <CardCategory className="program" text="Talk" />
        <CardCategory className="program" text="Branding" />
        <CardCategory />
      </div>
      <h1>Designing Brands in a Noisy World</h1>
    </div>
    <div class="details_grid">
      <div>
        <p>Date: 04.09.2025</p>
        <p>Venue: BLOX</p>
      </div>
      <div>
        <p>Time: 12:00-13:00</p>
        <p>Speaker: Sara Coleman</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <h3>( About )</h3>
    <div class="about_grid">
      <p class="about_text_1">
        In today’s crowded digital space, creating a brand that stands out is
        more challenging than ever. In this talk, Sara Coleman, a creative
        director at Coleman & Co. Branding (Berlin), delves into strategies for
        cutting through the noise. Using real-world examples from global
        campaigns, Sara will explore how to develop a strong visual identity and
        a compelling narrative that resonates with audiences. Whether you're
        working with a startup or a global brand, this session will help you
        craft a brand identity that speaks clearly and powerfully.
      </p>
      <div class="left_side">
        <img class="speaker_image" src="/imgs/speaker_image.png" alt="burger" />
        <p class="image_text">
          Sara Coleman has 15+ years of experience in branding for clients such
          as Adidas and Carhart.
        </p>
      </div>
      <p class="about_text_2">
        Sara will also share insights from her recent collaborations with
        leading sports apparel brands in the skiing and skateboarding scenes.
        Known for building bold, youthful brand identities, she has crafted
        campaigns that fuse high-energy photography with playful,
        community-driven storytelling—think snapshots from après-ski parties,
        dynamic quotes from pro snowboarders, and eye-catching imagery of tricks
        on the slopes. These projects have resonated strongly with younger
        audiences, gaining traction across social media and coming to life at
        branded events like DJ-led pop-ups and interactive showcases. It’s
        branding that feels alive, authentic, and unmistakably of-the-moment.
      </p>
    </div>
    <h3>( Discover More from Sara Coleman )</h3>
    <div class="socials_flexbox">
      <div class="socials_grid">
        <p>Instagram</p>
        <a>@sara_colemancreative</a>
      </div>
      <div class="socials_grid">
        <p>LinkedIn</p>
        <a>Sara Coleman/LinkedIn</a>
      </div>
      <div class="socials_grid">
        <p>Website</p>
        <a>www.saracolemancreative.com</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</Skelet>

<style>
  main {
    margin: 60px 0px;
  }
  h3,
  h1 {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
    margin-left: 20px;
    margin-right: 20px;
  }
  h3 {
    margin-top: 50px;
  }
  p {
    padding: 0px 20px;
  }
  .categories {
    display: flex;
    margin-bottom: 40px;
    gap: 10px;
    padding-left: 10px;
  }
  .socials_flexbox {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    width: 100%;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--Black, #060604);
  }
  .socials_grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--Black, #060604);
    padding-top: 15px;
    padding-bottom: 15px;
  }
  .socials_grid a {
    padding-left: 20px;
  }
  .details_grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--Black, #060604);
  }
  .details_grid p {
    padding: 15px 0px;
    width: 100%;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--Black, #060604);
    padding-left: 20px;
    border-left: 1px solid var(--Black, #060604);
  }

  .about_grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-rows: auto;
    row-gap: 30px;
  }
  .about_text_1 {
    grid-row: 1;
  }
  .left_side {
    grid-row: 2;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 10px;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: flex-end;
    padding-right: 70px;
  }
  .about_text_2 {
    grid-row: 3;
  }
  .speaker_image {
    border-radius: 30px;
    width: 63%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .image_text {
    width: 59%;
  }
</style>
